        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo PP-3x15-31-628 Narrow Pull Plates</b>\r\n<p>\r\nNarrow 3\" x 15\" commercial door pull plate with 8-3/8\" pull handle. Primarily used on aluminum store front doors, warehouses, factories and stores. Made of .050\" thick aluminum. Brushed aluminum with clear anodizing finish. Packaged with mounting hardware for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-PP-3x15-31-628_size.gif?v=1704354776\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo PP-3x15-31-628 Narrow Pull Plate\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/narrow-3-x-15-push-plate-don-jo-pp-3x15-628\"><b>3\" x 15\" Narrow Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with (2) different length screw so you can thru-bolt the handle or screw it directly to the plate.  Economy priced for budget conscious projects, yet high quality .050\" thick solid non-rusting aluminum with large sized 8-3/4\" handle.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Don-Jo PP-3x15-31-628 Narrow Pull Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Height: 8-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Mounting Holes: 8\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Brushed Aluminum</b> with Clear Anodizing</li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PP-3x15-31-628.pdf?v=1704262350\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo PP-3x15-31-628 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b> \r\n</p>",
